OL,3,C'Not one size fits all': Northern
OL,4,CIreland students leading path to
OL,5,Csuccess
OL,7,FBy Leah McNally
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland is in the best
OL,10,Fposition in the UK in terms of
OL,11,Fgraduate employment, according to the
OL,12,FHigher Education Statistics Agency
OL,13,F(HESA).
OL,15,FYet, as university costs, living
OL,16,Fexpenses, and student debt continue to
OL,17,Fmount, young people are increasingly
OL,18,Fseeking more financially efficient
OL,19,Froutes.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
