PN,41402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786627119
OL,3,C'Not one size fits all': Northern
OL,4,CIreland students leading path to
OL,5,Csuccess
OL,7,FLocal undergraduate unemployment
OL,8,Fstands at just 3.6%, nearly half the
OL,9,FUK average of 6.5%, with Scotland
OL,10,Ftrailing as the next lowest region at
OL,11,F5.5%, 15 months after graduation.
OL,13,FHigher Level Apprenticeships (HLAs)
OL,14,Fare on the up, and what could be
OL,15,Fbetter than earning an entry-level
OL,16,Fsalary alongside a tuition-free
OL,17,Fqualification, that allows students to
OL,18,Fbypass student debt entirely.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
