PN,41403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786627119
OL,3,C'Not one size fits all': Northern
OL,4,CIreland students leading path to
OL,5,Csuccess
OL,7,FThe amount of student loan borrowing
OL,8,Fcontinues to rise, reaching #6 billion
OL,9,Fas of 2025-2026 financial year with
OL,10,F#379 million paid out in undergraduate
OL,11,Flending, 4.8% more than the previous
OL,12,Fyear.
OL,14,FLocal institutions, including Queen's
OL,15,FUniversity Belfast and Ulster
OL,16,FUniversity, are leaning into these
OL,17,Fpathways across sectors like
OL,18,Fengineering, construction, ICT, food
OL,19,Fand drink, and hair and beauty.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
