PN,41404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786627119
OL,3,C'Not one size fits all': Northern
OL,4,CIreland students leading path to
OL,5,Csuccess
OL,7,FMargaret Topping, Queen's University
OL,8,FBelfast said: "Increasingly what we
OL,9,Fare developing our very initiative
OL,10,Fmodel such as a higher level
OL,11,Fapprenticeship.
OL,13,F"Where we are working in collaboration
OL,14,Fwith a company, a student can actually
OL,15,Fbe employed by a company from day one"
OL,17,FLevel 6 (undergraduate) and level 7
OL,18,F(post-graduate) apprenticeship new
OL,19,Fstarts saw a 14% increase in 2023-2024
OL,20,Ffrom the previous year.
OL,26,@pD@OOUuD@AOUwD@fO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/10
