CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786627119
OL,3,C'Not one size fits all': Northern
OL,4,CIreland students leading path to
OL,5,Csuccess
OL,7,FMost notably, accounting firms such as
OL,8,FKMGP, Deloitte, EY and PwC,
OL,9,Fcollaborate with universities here to
OL,10,Fprovide these types of opportunities.
OL,12,FRachael McGinty came straight out of
OL,13,Fsecondary school and into a level 4
OL,14,Fhigher apprenticeship, equivalent to a
OL,15,Fhigher national certificate or first
OL,16,Fyear of university undergraduate
OL,17,Fdegree.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/10
