PN,41406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786627119
OL,3,C'Not one size fits all': Northern
OL,4,CIreland students leading path to
OL,5,Csuccess
OL,7,FAfter considering traditional
OL,8,Funiversity she ultimately decided an
OL,9,Fapprenticeship was much more suited to
OL,10,Fher.
OL,12,F"I really learn so much better by
OL,13,Fdoing and an apprenticeship was always
OL,14,Fsomething in my mind and interested
OL,15,Fme."
OL,17,FShe continued: "There's so much out
OL,18,Fthere and it's not one size fits all
OL,19,Fbox."
OL,26,@tD@AOUwD@DO]yD@POU{D@EO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/10
