PN,41407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786627119
OL,3,C'Not one size fits all': Northern
OL,4,CIreland students leading path to
OL,5,Csuccess
OL,7,FHighlighting the practical value of
OL,8,Fearly workplace exposure, Louise Black
OL,9,Fof PwC told UTV: "I'd really encourage
OL,10,Fpeople to look at that higher
OL,11,Fapprentice route and I think it's a
OL,12,Ffantastic opportunity to as I say
OL,13,Fcombine real world experience and
OL,14,Flearning all at the same time."
OL,16,FShe continued: "Yes I learned lots in
OL,17,Fmy degree, and it really helped me
OL,18,Fkind of form the business knowledge
OL,19,Fthat I needed as well as some of the
OL,20,Ftechnical skills.
OL,26,@qD@ROUvD@_O]xD@POU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/10
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
