PN,41408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F414A1786627119
OL,3,C'Not one size fits all': Northern
OL,4,CIreland students leading path to
OL,5,Csuccess
OL,7,F"But actually that year I did in my
OL,8,Fwork placement, really brought that to
OL,9,Flife."
OL,11,FDespite their growth, HLAs remain
OL,12,Fconcentrated in STEM and technical
OL,13,Ffields.
OL,15,FFor those pursuing arts, humanities,
OL,16,For languages or those simply seeking
OL,17,Fthe traditional experience, university
OL,18,Fremains the primary choice.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/10
