OL,3,C'Not one size fits all': Northern
OL,4,CIreland students leading path to
OL,5,Csuccess
OL,7,FMargaret Topping continued: "There has
OL,8,Fbeen some debate in recent years given
OL,9,Fthe cost of higher education also
OL,10,Fgiven the difficulties and challenges
OL,11,Fof the job market.
OL,13,F"There has been increasing discussion
OL,14,Faround the value of higher education
OL,15,Fbut it is still two thirds of people
OL,16,Fwho believe that higher education is a
OL,17,Fgood opportunity for them."
OL,26,@oD@]OUuD@AOUyD@[O]
